Package: CellChatESS
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Signal Streaming for CellChat Inference
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: person("DENG", "Zifeng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zifengd8@gmail.com")
Author: DENG Zifeng [aut, cre]
Maintainer: DENG Zifeng <zifengd8@gmail.com>
Description: Implements Efficient Signal Streaming (ESS), an Rcpp
    acceleration method for triMean-based CellChat RNA workflows. ESS projects
    expression data to genes used by ligand-receptor, complex and cofactor
    calculations, evaluates sender-receiver pairs from observed expression
    support, streams bootstrap summaries, and optionally parallelizes
    bootstrap permutations with OpenMP while preserving a serial fast path,
    the CellChat probability model, and the object interface. Negative and
    non-finite signaling expression values are rejected because pruning
    requires finite non-negative expression input.
